MediaPipe Face Landmarker model
===============================

face_landmark_detector.onnx is Google MediaPipe's Face Landmarker 478-point face
landmark model exported to ONNX (producer: tf2onnx 1.17.0). The graph is
self-contained: its weights are stored inside the ONNX file, with no external
data file.

The model is used by crates/algo/src/face_mesh.rs to predict 478 face landmarks
for Face Reshape. It is not modified after export. See README.md in this
directory for the input/output contract, source URL, file size and checksum.

Upstream model: Google MediaPipe Face Landmarker,
https://ai.google.dev/edge/mediapipe/solutions/vision/face_landmarker
Upstream code: https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe

